				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-240155#post-2878445</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-240155/document-alpha-zeta-2#post-2878445</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 21 Jun 2017 01:47:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dazric</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1418057</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is amazing, but I don't think it's SCP-055, which makes it, if anything, more worrying. There's no mention of missing supplies as a result of 055, and it isn't indicated to have a decorated room. If anything,this is worse for what it represents. The Foundation failed. They've completely forgotten about this skip, and it's not properly contained,it could just walk out of it wanted to. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-240155#post-2825005</guid>
				<title>Re: IS IT 055???//????//////??????????</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-240155/document-alpha-zeta-2#post-2825005</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2017 06:28:41 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>bionelly</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2895221</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I think the infection thing was just supposed to be this guy's assumption. It doesn't seem like he really knows what's going on, other than that he's being held in some kind of facility, other people are being held there too, and it doesn't seem like a typical prison. He may have even overheard researchers talking about doing tests.Quarantine seems like a reasonable conclusion, even though we know it's wrong.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-240155#post-2821275</guid>
				<title>IS IT 055???//????//////??????????</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-240155/document-alpha-zeta-2#post-2821275</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 15 May 2017 07:03:39 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>3087025</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I did not assume it was&#8230;uh..the thing that isn't round? What was that called again?</p> <p>I actually assumed this was a person that was unseen, unheard, unknown. People would think that the ROOM was an anomaly, not the person. They would guard the ROOM, but no the person.<br /> I can't rightly explain the whole infection part&#8230;unless that is some headcannon I haven't seen yet.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
